ted, overly enterprisey, or was way too expensive for solo work. I wanted something simple that didn\u2019t require a \u201cplan,\u201d onboarding flow, or learning curve.<p>A few things people have asked so far:\n\u2022 No lock-in \u2014 you can export your invoices anytime  \n\u2022 No limits on the number of invoices  \n\u2022 No weird pricing tiers or upsells  \n\u2022 Works well on mobile  \n\u2022 You own your customer list (I don\u2019t touch it)<p>Here\u2019s what I\u2019m looking for from HN:\n\u2022 Brutally honest feedback  \n\u2022 Any missing \u201cmust-have\u201d features for solo entrepreneurs  \n\u2022 Performance/UX suggestions  \n\u2022 Security concerns I should address early  \n\u2022 Whether the $20/year model feels right<p>If anyone here freelances or runs side projects, I\u2019d love to know what your current <em>invoicin</em>g workflow looks like and what annoys you about existing tools.<p>Thanks for reading \u2014 happy to answer every question!"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["invoices"], "value": "Show HN: A $20/year <em>invoicin</em>g tool for solo developers (simple, fast, no bloat)"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://sidepay.app/"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_mightbefun", "story_46135247", "show_hn"], "author": "mightbefun", "children": [46135763], "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:00:05Z", "created_at_i": 1764774005, "num_comments": 4, "objectID": "46135247", "points": 13, "story_id": 46135247, "story_text": "Hi HN! I built a super lightweight invoicing platform for solo developers, freelancers, and one-person businesses. Most invoicing software costs $20\u2013$40&#x2F;month and is packed with features you don\u2019t need. Mine is $20&#x2F;year and focuses on the essentials:<p>\u2022 Create invoices in seconds  \n\u2022 Send invoices by email  \n\u2022 Automatic email reminders  \n\u2022 Recurring invoices  \n\u2022 Simple dashboard for paid&#x2F;unpaid tracking  \n\u2022 No team features, no CRM, no bloat<p>I built this because I freelance occasionally, and every invoicing tool I tried either felt bloated, overly enterprisey, or was way too expensive for solo work. I wanted something simple that didn\u2019t require a \u201cplan,\u201d onboarding flow, or learning curve.<p>A few things people have asked so far:\n\u2022 No lock-in \u2014 you can export your invoices anytime  \n\u2022 No limits on the number of invoices  \n\u2022 No weird pricing tiers or upsells  \n\u2022 Works well on mobile  \n\u2022 You own your customer list (I don\u2019t touch it)<p>Here\u2019s what I\u2019m looking for from HN:\n\u2022 Brutally honest feedback  \n\u2022 Any missing \u201cmust-have\u201d features for solo entrepreneurs  \n\u2022 Performance&#x2F;UX suggestions  \n\u2022 Security concerns I should address early  \n\u2022 Whether the $20&#x2F;year model feels right<p>If anyone here freelances or runs side projects, I\u2019d love to know what your current invoicing workflow looks like and what annoys you about existing tools.<p>Thanks for reading \u2014 happy to answer every question!", "title": "Show HN: A $20/year invoicing tool for solo developers (simple, fast, no bloat)", "updated_at": "2026-05-13T06:13:49Z", "url": "https://sidepay.app/"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "petethomas"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["invoices"], "value": "Trump <em>invokes</em> Defense Production Act for munitions, supply chains"}, "url": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["invoices"], "value": "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-<em>invokes</em>-defense-production-act-munitions-supply-chains-2026-06-16/"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_petethomas", "story_48565538"], "author": "petethomas", "children": [48565742, 48566392], "created_at": "2026-06-17T04:04:35Z", "created_at_i": 1781669075, "num_comments": 3, "objectID